      "ReviewText": "I have recently had such a pleasant experience working with Sunseeker’s customer service that I have to leave this review. The machine works well once it’s set up properly. It is so nice not to have to manually mow! It needed some work and a new battery after having it for over a year, but they made it easy to get it taken care of under the warranty, so I am still quite happy with the purchase.",
